e approach.\n\nReason: You have no made hand and very low potential to improve. The opponent showed weakness by checking, but the Ace on the board makes bluffing dangerous. Checking allows you to see a free turn card and preserves your chip stack while protecting your lead.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
